  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Warpbane Task Force",
    "summary": "Your Hallowed Ground covers:\n\n- your deployment zone, always\n- the area up to 6\" from your **PURIFIER SQUAD** units\n- No Man's Land for a phase, if half or more of the objectives in it are under your control as that phase begins\n- the enemy deployment zone for a phase, if half or more of the objectives in it are under your control as that phase begins\n\nYour **GREY KNIGHTS** units can re-roll 1s to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls) with their melee attacks and with ranged attacks against **visible** targets. A **PURIFIER SQUAD** unit, or a unit wholly inside your Hallowed Ground, can re-roll its Hit rolls instead.",
